<header class="ref-head cen-head"><p class="cty-kicker">History by century · The 1000s BCE</p><h1 class="research-title">The 11th century BCE</h1><p class="ref-lede">In the 1000s BCE, 117 recorded states existed somewhere in the world. 70 were founded and 6 came to an end. The great powers of the age included the Assyrian Empire, the Elamite Confederation and the Western Zhou.</p></header>
